|            | Support agentic tools management by meta tool                                      |                                                                         |
| MCP        | Support streamable HTTP/SSE/StdIO transport                                        | [MCP](https://doc.agentscope.io/tutorial/task_mcp.html)                 |
|            | Support both **stateful** and **stateless** mode MCP Client                        |                                                                         |
